(gen_random_uuid(), 'melbourne', 'local_legend', 'The Day the Bridge Came Down is the story to ask about', 'In Melbourne, The Day the Bridge Came Down is a useful lore thread. On 15 October 1970, with dozens of workers mid-construction on the West Gate Bridge, a span collapsed into the water below in what remains Australia''s deadliest industrial accident: thirty-five men were killed. Keep it as a sourced starting point, then let the surrounding place make the story tangible.', 'Lore source trail: The Day the Bridge Came Down', '🗝️', null, '{"source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Gate_Bridge"}'::jsonb, '{"accessed": "2026-08-02", "confidence": "documented", "profile": "local-expert-addons", "review_state": "source_checked", "rights": "original_lore_copy", "rights_review": "link_only_ok", "seed_kind": "story", "seed_title": "The Day the Bridge Came Down", "wave": "2026-08"}'::jsonb, 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Gate_Bridge', 'cc0', 180, 'reference_only'),
